* R2: [unit] m] Sample aperture RADIUS
* L1: [unit] m] Collimation length: source aperture to sample
* Rbs: [unit] m] Beamstop radius
* Flux: [unit] n/s/cm2/st/AA] ASSUMED source brilliance - all absolute rates scale linearly with this
* Sw: [unit] m] Sample face size (set ~0 to expose the unscattered direct beam for geometry checks)
* 
* %Link 
* 
* %End 
